    what they are looking for easily. We may also use functionality cookies to recognize you when you return to our
    website. This enables us to personalize our content for you and remember your preferences (for example, your choice
    of language or region).
  </p>
  <p>
    Most browsers automatically accept cookies from websites. If you go into your browser settings you can choose to
    refuse all or some cookies. However, if you set your browser settings to block all cookies you may not be able to
    access all or parts of our website.
  </p>

